# Harness state is not tracked. Repo-scoped slash commands under .claude/commands/ are, because they
# are repo behaviour (decision 0113 — rationale in retro-0 D4), and so is .claude/settings.json,
# because it enables the repo's plugins.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/settings.json

